  "title": "Lakers LeBron James Working On Mid Post Work In New York City [Watch]",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":517018,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/LebronJames_April2021-1024x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-517018\"/><figcaption>LOS ANGELES, CA - APRIL 30: LeBron James #23 of the Los Angeles Lakers looks on during the game against the Sacramento Kings on April 30, 2021 at STAPLES Center in Los Angeles, California. NOTE TO USER: User expressly acknowledges and agrees that, by downloading and/or using this Photograph, user is consenting to the terms and conditions of the Getty Images License Agreement. Mandatory Copyright Notice: Copyright 2021 NBAE (Photo by Adam Pantozzi/NBAE via Getty Images)</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Earlier this month, LeBron James took part in the Drew League, but while speaking with ESPN's <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/34256107/lebron-james-42-point-show-lights-drew-league-kyrie-irving-no-shows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Dave McMenamin</a>, the future Hall Of Famer revealed that he's 100 percent healthy. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“I’m 100 percent healthy,” James said.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That good news to hear if you are a Los Angeles Lakers fan about their superstar that missed 26 games last season.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>James was recently in New York working on his mid-post moves at Chris Brinkley and Carmelo Anthony's [Summit New York] gym in New York City. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CgdW64oAj-2/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/CgdW64oAj-2/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LeBron James has made numerous early investments in his Hall of Fame career that are starting to pay off. Including one with a company called Blaze Pizza. He now owns 19 franchises. That investment has blossomed into a 50 million investment,<a href=\"https://thesportsrush.com/nba-news-lebron-james-turned-a-million-into-50m-from-his-2012-investment-in-blaze-pizza-which-according-to-forbes-is-the-fastest-growing-restaurant-chain-ever/\"> according to Forbes</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/BleacherReport/status/884862067991343104?s=20u0026t=afyHsKtYqEBBkzvhvie4VQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/BleacherReport/status/884862067991343104?s=20&amp;t=afyHsKtYqEBBkzvhvie4VQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Rovell, Blaze Pizza at the time sold a percentage of the business to a private equity company for $250 million. The estimate was James's financial participation could also rise to $35 million or $40 million when he receives endorsement payments which form part of his agreement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
